A small C compiler tool suite for Tenuis. This is a small C subdialect
based on ANSI C99, plus a few libraries intended to make it mostly
compatable with ANSI C99. This contains a preprocessor, a C to IR
compiler, and a (naive, unoptimized) IR to Assembler compiler. An IR
optimizer and Assembler optimizer are in the works. Each one reads text
from stdin and writes the result to stdout.

Note: A few instructions have been added since after the IR -> ASM compiler
was made; at some point, the awkward cases using bit shifts or multi-
instructio sequences to emulate the ones that didnt exist beforehand
will be replaced.
